Bundled source is the minimal floating-point resampler subset: resample.c,
arch.h, and the public speex_resampler.h header. The public header defines the
VolEq-specific OUTSIDE_SPEEX and RANDOM_PREFIX values so its generated Clang
module is self-contained; the resampling implementation is otherwise unchanged.
